@startuml
title Workflow for getRadioStationData

|Main Thread|
start

-getRadioStationData()

if (RequestContainer exists?) then (No)
    -Create new RequestContainer
else (Yes)
endif

:Add request to RequestContainer;

if (Max elements or wait time reached?) then (Yes)
    -Add LookupJob with RequestContainer to the queue
    -Reset waiting RequestContainer
    stop
else (No)
    if (Coroutine is running?) then (Yes)
        -Cancel coroutine
    else (No)
    endif
    -Start Coroutine
    |Coroutine|
    -Wait the configured debounce delay
    -Add LookupJob with RequestContainer to the queue
    -Reset waiting RequestContainer
    stop
endif

@enduml